# Copy to .env and adjust if needed -- even an empty .env is required so
# `docker-compose` can parse this service (see CONTEXT.md, "Operational
# note"). No API key needed: this crew runs against the local `ollama`
# service defined in the repo's docker-compose.yml, not a paid provider.

# Override the shared default model (see crew/config.py) if you've
# pulled a different one, e.g.:
# CREW_DEFAULT_MODEL=llama3.2:3b

# Per-agent overrides, once you've confirmed a larger/different local
# model still runs in reasonable time, e.g.:
# PATO_MODEL=qwen2.5:0.5b
# WARDEN_MODEL=llama3.2:3b

# Only needed if you run main.py outside docker-compose (i.e. Ollama
# isn't reachable at the default in-network hostname):
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
